{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"8f6d70f76e70fab512caffce6e8f578a6e3546bb6009fa88a609529f7493cb25","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"ff891672cbe466bfc528600f8cd25b7b9180949d59679f1178836e0102392f44","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source name is \"Sceptre of the Archlich\". The target 死灵权杖 means roughly \"necromantic sceptre\" and loses the \"Archlich\" (大巫妖) meaning. In pinned source world-artifacts.lua, this item is define_as SET_SCEPTRE_LICH, forms a set with SET_LICH_RING, and uses set_desc key archlich, so the Archlich identity matters to the set's lore. Without a frozen terminology entry for this name, it should be reviewed."},{"revision_key":"ffa77aef82eb16f84cf30296ac11291883baae8a494cbb97b9b5a686459bb60f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ffb21dd4ccd3ada3cb0abcecd6ee531904750bce1b6d8b41fdc441b29cf91839","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ffd4751c6be1cc762e0917b44dbb91251580eeee3caa072dc64b9ba51cfe5068","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ffe80f4c81073264933cfb717896ef7ecf7004171e9a9030e065ac3dab3101ae","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source adjective \"strange\" is missing. The source reads \"A strange portal to some place else.\", but the target 通向其他地方的传送门。 drops 奇怪的/奇异的, so the portal's odd quality is lost."},{"revision_key":"fff8487389cbed3c2897bfc85f6d3c264537cae71a0985cdbf5e67c64a34c076","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source says golems \"can become unstoppable\", but the target 岩石傀儡是可怕的敌人并且不可阻挡 says they are always unstoppable and drops the \"can become\" condition. In pinned source summon-melee.lua, the summoned golem is given resolvers.talents{[Talents.T_UNSTOPPABLE]=3,...}. Unstoppable is a talent it can activate, not a permanent state, so the translation misstates the mechanic. It should say something like 可以变得不可阻挡."}]}